# Only the website runtime and publication documentation belong in this repository.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/index.html
!/README.md
!/大冒險地圖/
!/示範1_摹寫配對/
!/示範2_五柳先生傳課文填字/
!/示範3_圓周長打怪RPG/
!/first-puff/

# Publish only the tobacco/betel game's runtime and selected illustrations.
/first-puff/*
!/first-puff/index.html
!/first-puff/game.html
!/first-puff/config.js
!/first-puff/images/
/first-puff/images/*
!/first-puff/images/*.webp
!/first-puff/images/oral-warning-realistic.png

# Private/local files, source notes and generated test output.
**/tests/
**/test-results/
**/node_modules/
**/assets/design/
**/*.json
**/*.py
**/*.cjs
**/*.md
**/*.txt
**/cover-art.png
**/assets/characters/mage.png
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
!/README.md
!/大冒險地圖/FONT-LICENSE.txt
!/first-puff/README.md
